000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. REPLDEMO.
000300 DATA DIVISION.
000400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000500     REPLACE ==:PFX:== BY ==WS==.
000600 01  :PFX:-LIMIT        PIC 9(5) VALUE 5000.
000700 01  :PFX:-BALANCE      PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
000800     REPLACE OFF.
000900     COPY CUSTREC REPLACING ==:TAG:== BY ==IN==.
001000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001100 MAIN-PARA.
001200         IF IN-PREMIUM
001300             COMPUTE WS-BALANCE = IN-AMOUNT * 2
001400         END-IF
001500         IF WS-BALANCE > WS-LIMIT
001600             DISPLAY 'OVER LIMIT'
001700         END-IF
001800         GOBACK.
